<title>USA: AMEX to trade Kimberly-Clark LEAPS from August 4.</title>
<headline>AMEX to trade Kimberly-Clark LEAPS from August 4.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The American Stock Exchange (AMEX) said Thursday it will list long term options known as LEAPS (long term equity anticipation securities) on shares of Kimberly-Clark Corp on August 4.</p>
<p>The options will open with strike prices of 40, 50 and 60 and have expirations in January 1999 and January 2000.</p>
<p>Kimberly-Clark shares ended unchanged at 50-11/16 Thursday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago derivatives desk, 312 408 8750))</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
